        <h2 class="sec-headline">Who Has Controlled GAESA</h2>
        <p class="sec-lead">GAESA's leadership has been inseparable from the Castro family since its founding. Its first major leader was Raúl Castro's son-in-law. After his death, the current executive president — already US-sanctioned — manages its international assets.</p>

