        <p class="sec-lead">The United States formally designated GAESA as a sanctioned entity on May 7, 2026, under <a href="/eo/14404" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;">Executive Order 14404</a> signed by President Trump on May 1. The State Department administered the designation; Treasury's OFAC enforces it. The designation freezes any US-jurisdiction assets and prohibits American persons from doing business with GAESA or its subsidiaries.</p>
